I will also need to mock HttpContext, INetworkManager, and ILogger. I will use Moq for that.

I will write a test class with tests for:
- Local request (should call next and not log warning)
- Remote request allowed (should call next and not log warning)
- Remote request denied (should log warning and set status code 503)

